SUMMARY:Understanding Body
DESCRIPTION: \nMove\, notice\, and discover what the body already knows. \nThis movement-based workshop invites participants to become more aware of how they move\, feel\, and respond in everyday life. Through slow\, intentional observation and curiosity\, the session decentres performance\, bringing exploration into focus instead. Understanding Body is an evolving practice that participants actively co-create. We do not simply carry the body: we experience it\, learn from it\, and communicate through it. \nPlease Note:\nThe session is open to experienced practitioners and novices alike.\nThe session has limited seats; RSVP required\, with spots confirmed via email. \nVenue: Gallery\n\n\nA Movement Practice for Everyone\nFor Ages 16+\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeib_3yksTGkZsoTBB5gTZ0XCJcy9slqynYLnvAkE6js8FA0Q/viewform?usp=publish-editor)\n*Facilitator*: Surendra Tekale\n*Event Categories*: Dance\, Workshops
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/understanding-body/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Dance,Workshops
